msgstr ""
"タンクに `{{< gd-icon RayCast3D >}}`RayCast3D` 子要素を追加し、**ターゲット位"
"置** を `(0, -1, 0)` に設定してください。"

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"Feel free to experiment with the interpolation amount. We found `12` to work "
