"`。お好みで任意のキー/ボタンに割り当ててください。"
msgstr ""

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.ja.md
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"json\n"
"\"If you're familiar with Godot's 3D orientation, you'll also notice that "
"the character is facing the **+Z** direction, which is backwards. Select the "
"{{< gd-icon Skeleton3D >}}`Skeleton3D` node and set its **Y** Rotation to "
"`180` to correct this.\","
msgstr ""
"```json\n"
"\"If you're familiar with Godot's 3D orientation, you'll also notice that "
"the character is facing the **+Z** direction, which is backwards. Select the "
"{{< gd-icon Skeleton3D >}}`Skeleton3D` node and set its **Y** Rotation to "
"`180` to correct this.\","

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.ja.md
msgid ""
"move_and_slide()\n"
"gdscript\n"
"func get_move_input(delta):\n"
"    var vy = velocity.y\n"
"    velocity.y = 0\n"
"    var input = Input.get_vector(\"left\", \"right\", \"forward\", "
"\"back\")\n"
"    var dir = Vector3(input.x, 0, input.y).rotated(Vector3.UP, "
"spring_arm.rotation.y)\n"
"    velocity = lerp(velocity, dir * speed, acceleration * delta)\n"
"    velocity.y = vy\n"
"gdscript\n"
"@export var mouse_sensitivity = 0.0015\n"
"gdscript\n"
"func _unhandled_input(event):\n"
"    if event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n"
"        spring_arm.rotation.x -= event.relative.y * mouse_sensitivity\n"
"        spring_arm.rotation_degrees.x = clamp(spring_arm.rotation_degrees.x, "
"-90.0, 30.0)\n"
"        spring_arm.rotation.y -= event.relative.x * mouse_sensitivity\n"
"gdscript\n"
"@export var rotation_speed = 12.0\n"
"gdscript\n"
"    if velocity.length() > 1.0:\n"
"        model.rotation.y = lerp_angle(model.rotation.y, "
"spring_arm.rotation.y, rotation_speed * delta)\n"
"gdscript\n"
"    velocity = lerp(velocity, dir * speed, acceleration * delta)\n"
"    var vl = velocity * model.transform.basis\n"
"    anim_tree.set(\"parameters/IWR/blend_position\", Vector2(vl.x, -vl.z) / "
"speed)\n"
"gdscript\n"
"var attacks = [\n"
"    \"1h_slice_diagonal\",\n"
"    \"1h_slice_horizontal\",\n"
"    \"1h_attack_chop\"\n"
"]\n"
"gdscript\n"
"    if event.is_action_pressed(\"attack\"):\n"
"        anim_state.travel(attacks.pick_random())\n"
"gdscript\n"
"    if is_on_floor() and Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"jump\"):\n"
"        velocity.y = jump_speed\n"
"        jumping = true\n"
"        anim_tree.set(\"parameters/conditions/grounded\", false)\n"
"    anim_tree.set(\"parameters/conditions/jumping\", jumping)\n"
"gdscript\n"
"var last_floor = true\n"
"gdscript\n"
"    # We just hit the floor after being in the air\n"
"    if is_on_floor() and not last_floor:\n"
"        jumping = false\n"
"        anim_tree.set(\"parameters/conditions/grounded\", true)\n"
"    last_floor = is_on_floor()\n"
"gdscript\n"
"    # We're in the air, but we didn't jump\n"
"    if not is_on_floor() and not jumping:\n"
"        anim_state.travel(\"Jump_Idle\")\n"
"        anim_tree.set(\"parameters/conditions/grounded\", false)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.ja.md
msgid "### カメラ機能"
msgstr ""

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.ja.md
msgid ""
"春季アームのプロパティで、**スプリング長**を `5`、**マージン**を `0.1`、**位"
"置**を `(0, 2.5, 0)` に設定します。"
msgstr ""

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.ja.md
msgid ""
"《{{< gd-icon SpringArm3D >}}》`SpringArm3D`ノードはレイキャストを実行した"
"後、その子オブジェクトを衝突点に移動させることで動作します。これをカメラに応"
"用すると、プレイヤーとカメラの間に障害物が一切入らない状態を実現でき、この長"
"さを調整することでズーム機能を実装することも可能です。"
msgstr ""

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.ja.md
msgid ""
"機能する制御可能なキャラクターにチェイスカメラと複数のアニメーションを追加し"
"ました。次は何が必要でしょうか？"
msgstr ""

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"Size and position the capsule to enclose the character's body. For "
"reference, here are the values I used:"
msgstr ""
"カプセルのサイズと位置を調整し、キャラクターの全身を覆うようにします。参考ま"
"でに、私が使用した数値は以下の通りです。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"In this recipe, we'll assume you've already imported your character model "
"and animations, and that you're set up {{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}"
"`AnimationTree` to handle transitioning and blending the animations. If you "
"haven't yet, see [Importing Assets](/4.x/3d/assets/importing_assets/) and "
"[Character Animation](/4.x/3d/assets/character_animation/) for details. As a "
"reminder, we're using the art packs linked in the [section description](/"
"godot_recipes/4.x/3d/assets/)."
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"このレシピでは、既にキャラクターモデルとアニメーションをインポートしており、"
"アニメーションの遷移やブレンド処理用に {{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}"
"`AnimationTree` が適切に設定されていることを前提に進めます。まだ準備ができて"
"いない場合は、[アセットのインポート方法](/4.x/3d/assets/importing_assets/) お"
"よび [キャラクターアニメーションについて](/4.ex/3d/assets/"
"character_animation/) を参照してください。参考までに、ここでは [セクション説"
"明](/godot_recipes/4.x/ja/3d/assets/) でリンクされているアートパックを使用し"
"ています。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"The {{< gd-icon SpringArm3D >}}`SpringArm3D` node works by casting a ray and "
"then moving its children to the collision point. Using this for a camera "
"means nothing can get between the camera and the player, and we can "
"implement zoom by varying this length."
msgstr ""
"《{{< gd-icon SpringArm3D >}}》`SpringArm3D`ノードはレイキャストを実行した"
"後、その子オブジェクトを衝突点に移動させることで動作します。これをカメラに応"
"用すると、プレイヤーとカメラの間に障害物が一切入らない状態を実現でき、この長"
"さを調整することでズーム機能を実装することも可能です。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"Add one as a child of the root node, and then add a {{< gd-icon Camera3D >}}"
"`Camera3D` as a child of that."
msgstr ""
"ルートノードの子として追加し、その後に `{{< gd-icon Camera3D >}}`Camera3D` を"
"その子要素として追加してください。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"`anim_state` is a reference to the animation state machine, which we can use "
"to call transitions between animations. See the [Character Animation](/4.x/"
"3d/assets/character_animation/) recipe for how we set these up."
msgstr ""
"`anim_state` はアニメーション状態マシンへの参照で、これを使用して異なるアニ"
"メーション間の遷移を呼び出すことができます。設定方法については、[キャラクター"
"アニメーション](/4.x/3d/assets/character_animation/) レシピを参照してくださ"
"い。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"You should be able to move forward/back/left/right (without any animations "
"yet)."
msgstr ""
"あなたは前進／後退／左移動／右移動ができるようになります（まだアニメーション"
"はありません）。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"In `get_move_input()`, we're setting the player's velocity. Just after that, "
"we can set the blend position:"
msgstr ""
"In `get_move_input()`, we're setting the player's velocity. Just after that, "
"we can set the blend position:"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"Then, we want to detect mouse motion and rotate the spring arm accordingly. "
"Rotating the arm around the **X** axis tilts it up and down (using the "
"mouse's *y* motion), and rotating it around **Y** changes its facing "
"direction (using the mouse's *x* motion). We also clamp the camera's tilt so "
"that it doesn't go too far up/down."
msgstr ""
"その後、マウスの動きを検知し、それに応じてスプリングアームを回転させます。"
"アームを**X**軸周りに回転させると上下に傾きます（マウスのy軸方向の動きが反映"
"されます）。また、**Y**軸周りの回転は向きを変えます（マウスのx軸方向の動きが"
"反映されます）。さらに、カメラの傾斜角度が過度にならないように制限を設けま"
"す。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"Next, we need to know when we touch the ground, so we can transition out of "
"the \"Jump_Idle\" animation. To do this, we need to keep track of our "
"grounded status by comparing it with the previous frame. Add a new variable "
"at the top:"
msgstr ""
"次に、地面に接地したタイミングを把握する必要があります。これにより、"
"「Jump_Idle」アニメーションから移行可能になります。これを実現するためには、前"
"フレームと比較することで接地状態を追跡する必要があります。上部に新しい変数を"
"追加しましょう。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"You've imported a rigged, animated 3D character in Godot and set up its "
"animations using {{< gd-icon AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree`. Now you need "
"to implement movement: you need a character controller."
msgstr ""
"Godot環境でリグ設定済みのアニメーション3Dキャラクターをインポートし、{{< gd-"
"icon AnimationTree >}}`AnimationTree`を使ってそのアニメーションを設定したとこ"
"ろですね。次は移動機能を実装する必要があります：キャラクタコントローラが必要"
"です。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"Before we do anything else, this is a good point to test things out. You can "
"make a quick test scene with a big {{< gd-icon StaticBody3D >}}"
"`StaticBody3D` for the ground, or start making a scene using the dungeon "
"pack assets."
msgstr ""
"その前に、これは機能をテストする絶好の機会です。地面に大きな `{{< gd-icon "
"StaticBody3D >}}StaticBody3Ld` を使ったクイックテストシーンを作成するか、ダン"
"ジョンパックアセットを使用してシーン制作を開始してください。"

#: 3D/assets/character_controller.md
msgid ""
"Note that we're rotating the input vector using the camera's rotation - our "
"character is going to move forward in whatever direction the camera is "
"facing."
msgstr ""
