"グナルを使ってコインを削除します。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_04.md
msgid ""
"In the last part, we learned about transforms, a very important concept in "
"3D that records an object's local orientation in space, and used it to move "
"our KinematicBody character. This time, we're going to look at another type "
"of 3D node: the {{< gd-icon Area3D >}}`Area3D`."
msgstr ""
"前回は、3Dグラフィックスにおいて非常に重要な概念である「トランスフォーム」に"
"ついて学びました。この概念はオブジェクトの空間内での局所的な向きを記録するも"
"ので、実際にKinematicBodyキャラクターを動かす際に活用しました。今回は別タイプ"
"の3Dノードである{{< gd-icon Area3D >}}`Area3D`について見ていきましょう。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_04.md
msgid ""
"Now we need a collision shape, so add a `CollisionShape` node and choose a\n"
"`CylinderShape` for it. If you rotate it 90 degrees around **z**, it will "
"fit\n"
"the coin shape pretty well."
msgstr ""
"import pygame\n"
"from pygmy import Game, Node\n"
"\n"
"class CoinGame(Game):\n"
"    def setup_nodes(self, root_node):\n"
"        coin_node = Node(\"Coin\")\n"
"        coin_shape_node = Node(\"CollisionShape\", parent=coin_node)\n"
"        cylinder_shape_node = Node(\"CylinderShape\", "
"parent=coin_shape_node)\n"
"\n"
"        # コインノードに衝突判定用の円筒形を追加\n"
"        coin_shape_node.attach_to(root_node)\n"
"\n"
"    def update_nodes(self, root_node):\n"
"        coin_node = root_node.find(\"Coin\")\n"
"        if coin_node:\n"
"            angle = pygame.math.Vector2()\n"
"            angle.rotate_ip(90, pygame.math.Vector2.right())  # 回転角度を 90"
"度（z軸周り）に変更\n"
"\n"
"            # 衝突判定用の形状を調整\n"
"            coin_shape_node.set_radius(1)  # 半径を 1ユニットに設定\n"
"            coin_shape_node.set_height(5)  # 高さを 5ユニットに設定\n"
"\n"
"if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n"
"    game = CoinGame()\n"
"    game.run()\n"
"```"

