#: ai/homing_missile.md
msgid ""
"The node setup and behavior of the missile is the same you would use for a "
"\"dumb\" bullet. If you're creating many bullet types, you can use "
"inheritance to base all your projectiles on the same core setup."
msgstr ""
"ノードの設定とミサイルの挙動は、従来の「単純な」弾丸と同様の仕組みを採用して"
