"spritesheet_animation/)\n"
"- [Top-down character](/godot_recipes/4.x/2d/topdown_movement/#option-2-"
"rotate-and-move)\n"
"- [Transforms](/godot_recipes/4.x/math/transforms)"
msgstr ""
"- [スプライトシートアニメーション](/godot_recipes/4.x/ja/animation/"
"spritesheet_animation/)\n"
"- [見下ろし型キャラクター操作](/godot_recipes/4.x/ja/2d/topdown_movement/"
