"smoothly avoiding obstacles."
msgstr ""

#: ai/context_map.ja.md ai/context_map.md
msgid "### Implementation (Godot 4)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/context_map.ja.md ai/context_map.md
msgid "### The Algorithm"
msgstr ""

#: ai/context_map.ja.md ai/context_map.md
msgid ""
"> [!NOTE]\n"
"> **Godot 3 to 4 Migration Summarized**:\n"
"> - `KinematicBody2D` -> `CharacterBody2D`.\n"
"> - `intersect_ray` now takes a `PhysicsRayQueryParameters2D` object.\n"
"> - `linear_interpolate` -> `lerp`."
msgstr ""

#: ai/context_map.ja.md ai/context_map.md
msgid ""
"1. Define a set of ray directions around the agent.\n"
"2. Calculate **Interest** based on the target (e.g., a path or player).\n"
"3. Calculate **Danger** by Raycasting 2D.\n"
"4. Subtract Danger from Interest.\n"
"5. Choose the direction by summing the remaining vectors."
msgstr ""

