#: 2D/2d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"* The `snap` vector is now our local down vector, so it will always point "
"directly into the slope.\n"
"* The `floor_normal` parameter is also changed to the local up direction (`-"
"transform.y`).\n"
"* We convert velocity to global by rotating it to match the player's "
"rotation, then revert the resulting velocity back to local by doing the "
"reverse."
msgstr ""
