#: 2D/moving_platforms.ja.md
msgid "### セットアップ方法"
msgstr ""

#: 2D/moving_platforms.ja.md
msgid ""
"自分のレベル／ワールドにプラットフォームを追加し、実際に試してみてください："
msgstr ""

#: 2D/moving_platforms.ja.md
msgid ""
"gdscript\n"
"extends Node2D"
msgstr ""

#: 2D/moving_platforms.ja.md
msgid ""
"func start_tween():\n"
"    var tween = "
"get_tree().create_tween().set_process_mode(Tween.TWEEN_PROCESS_PHYSICS)\n"
"    tween.set_loops().set_parallel(false)\n"
"    tween.tween_property($AnimatableBody2d, \"position\", offset, duration / "
"2)\n"
"    tween.tween_property($AnimatableBody2d, \"position\", Vector2.ZERO, "
"duration / 2)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: 2D/moving_platforms.ja.md
msgid "### プラットフォームの作成"
