"Godot considers an angle of `0` degrees to be pointing along the `x` axis. "
"This means that a node's forward direction (`transform.x`) is to the right. "
"You should ensure that your character's sprite is also drawn pointing to the "
"right.\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"
