#: 2D/grid_pathfinding.md
msgid ""
"Godot provides a number of methods for pathfinding. For this recipe, we'll "
"consider the `A*` algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Godot は経路探索のための複数の手法を提供しています。今回のレシピでは「A*(エー"
