#: 2D/line_collision.md
msgid "Next, we need to add collision shapes to the body. We have two options:"
msgstr ""
"次に、ボディに衝突形状を追加する必要があります。以下の2つのオプションがありま"
"す："

#: 2D/line_collision.md
msgid ""
"{{< gd-icon SegmentShape2D >}}`SegmentShape2D` does not have any width "
"component, so if you need your line collision to have a thickness, you can "
"use a rectangle collision instead."
msgstr ""
": SegmentShape2D`セグメント形状2Dは幅成分を持たないため、線の衝突判定に厚みが"
"必要な場合には、代わりに矩形の衝突判定を使用することをお勧めします。"

#: 2D/line_collision.md
msgid "### Option 2: Using {{< gd-icon RectangleShape2D >}}`RectangleShape2D`"
msgstr ""
"### オプション2：{{< gd-icon RectangleShape2D >}}`RectangleShape2D`を使用する"
"場合"

#: 2D/line_collision.md
msgid ""
"{{< gd-icon SegmentShape2D >}}`SegmentShape2D` is a line-segment collision "
"shape. The idea here is to create a segment collision for each pair of "
"points in the line."
msgstr ""
"{{< gd-icon SegmentShape2D >}}`SegmentShape2D` は線分衝突形状です。この手法の"
"目的は、直線上の各点ペアに対して個別のセグメント衝突を作成することです。"

#: 2D/line_collision.md
msgid ""
"{{% notice note %}}\n"
"You can use an {{< gd-icon Area2D >}}`Area2D` instead if you want to detect "
"overlap with the line rather than collision.\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"
msgstr ""
"{{% notice note %}}\n"
"衝突ではなく線との重複を検出したい場合は、代わりに {{< gd-icon Area2D >}}"
"`Area2D` を使用することも可能です。\n"
"{{% /notice %}}"

